Propellerhead Remote Mapping File
File Format Version	1.0.0
Control Surface Manufacturer	Akai
Control Surface Model	MPK Mini Play
Map Version	1.0.0


//======================================================================
//  NN-XT Advanced Sampler
//
//  Pads      -> reserved (no drum pads on NN-XT)
//  Knobs 1-4A-> filter & amp attack/decay (CC21-24)
//  Knobs 1-4B-> release & output          (CC25-28)
//  Joystick X-> Pitch Bend
//  Joystick Y-> Mod Wheel
//  Keyboard  -> Keyboard
//======================================================================

Scope	Propellerheads	NN-XT Advanced Sampler
// Define Group	Keyboard Shortcut Variations
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item	Scale	Mode

Map	_Scope		"NN-XT"
Map	Keyboard		Keyboard

// --- Pads (reserved) ---------------------------------
// NN-XT has no drum pads; the lines below are ready-to-enable templates.
//Map	Pad 1		Select Previous Patch
//Map	Pad 2		Select Next Patch
//Map	Pad 3		External Controller
//Map	Pad 4		Filter Freq
//Map	Pad 5		Filter Res

// --- Knob Bank A (CC21-24): filter & amp shape ---
Map	Knob 1 A		Filter Freq
Map	Knob 2 A		Filter Res
Map	Knob 3 A		Amp Env Attack
Map	Knob 4 A		Amp Env Decay

// --- Knob Bank B (CC25-28): release & output ---------
Map	Knob 1 B		Amp Env Release
Map	Knob 2 B		Mod Env Decay
Map	Knob 3 B		External Controller
Map	Knob 4 B		Master Volume

// --- Joystick / wheels ------------------------------
Map	Joystick X		Pitch Bend
Map	Joystick Y		Mod Wheel